                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g0489"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：离婚财产分割请求权 ⊑ 形成诉权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g0489"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>离婚财产分割请求权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>形成诉权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g0682"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：有效的民事法律行为 ⊑ 民事法律行为</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g0682"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>有效的民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g0683"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：效力未定的民事法律行为 ⊑ 民事法律行为</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g0683"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>效力未定的民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g0684"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：可撤销的民事法律行为 ⊑ 民事法律行为</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g0684"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>可撤销的民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g0685"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：无效的民事法律行为 ⊑ 民事法律行为</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g0685"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>无效的民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g0686"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：成立未生效的民事法律行为 ⊑ 民事法律行为</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g0686"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>成立未生效的民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>民事法律行为</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c20"><lrml:Comment>不满八周岁的未成年人为无民事行为能力人（第20条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c20"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under8"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c19"><lrml:Comment>八周岁以上的未成年人为限制民事行为能力人（第19条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c19"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under8"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c21-1"><lrml:Comment>不能辨认自己行为的成年人为无民事行为能力人（第21条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c21-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c21-2"><lrml:Comment>八周岁以上的未成年人不能辨认自己行为的，为无民事行为能力人（优先于第19条）（第21条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c21-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c22"><lrml:Comment>不能完全辨认自己行为的成年人为限制民事行为能力人（第22条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c22"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c18-full"><lrml:Comment>成年人为完全民事行为能力人（第18条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c18-full"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c18-emancipated"><lrml:Comment>十六周岁以上、以自己劳动收入为主要生活来源的未成年人，视为完全民事行为能力人（第18条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c18-emancipated"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age16plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownLabourIncomeMainSource"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotFullyDiscern"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1079"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：营利法人的权力机构 ⊑ 营利法人的机构</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1079"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>营利法人的权力机构</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>营利法人的机构</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1086"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：营利法人的执行机构 ⊑ 营利法人的机构</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1086"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>营利法人的执行机构</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>营利法人的机构</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1095"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：营利法人的监督机构 ⊑ 营利法人的机构</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1095"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>营利法人的监督机构</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>营利法人的机构</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1236"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：组织机构的变更 ⊑ 法人的变更</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1236"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>组织机构的变更</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法人的变更</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1247"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：法人的组织性质变更 ⊑ 法人的变更</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1247"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法人的组织性质变更</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法人的变更</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1249"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：其他事项的变更 ⊑ 法人的变更</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1249"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>其他事项的变更</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法人的变更</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1446"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：口头形式 ⊑ 意思表示的形式</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1446"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>口头形式</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>意思表示的形式</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1449"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：书面形式 ⊑ 意思表示的形式</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1449"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>书面形式</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>意思表示的形式</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1451"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：默示形式 ⊑ 意思表示的形式</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1451"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>默示形式</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>意思表示的形式</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-valid-default"><lrml:Comment>无无效、效力待定、确定不生效事由的，民事法律行为有效（第143条的推定）（第143条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-valid-default"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pendingValidity"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ineffective"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c153-2"><lrml:Comment>违背公序良俗的无效（第153条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c153-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatesPublicOrder"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-void-not-valid"><lrml:Comment>无效行为不是有效行为（第155条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-void-not-valid"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c155"><lrml:Comment>无效的或者被撤销的民事法律行为自始没有法律约束力（第155条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c155"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noBindingForceAbInitio"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c144"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力人实施的民事法律行为无效（第144条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c144"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c146"><lrml:Comment>以虚假的意思表示实施的民事法律行为无效（第146条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c146"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shamIntent"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c146-hidden"><lrml:Comment>被隐藏的行为的效力，依照有关法律规定处理（不因通谋虚伪而当然无效）（第146条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c146-hidden"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concealedBy"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shamIntent"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validityByApplicableLaw"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c153-1"><lrml:Comment>违反法律、行政法规的强制性规定的无效；但该规定不导致无效的除外（第153条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c153-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatesMandatoryProvision"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provisionNotInvalidating"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c154"><lrml:Comment>恶意串通，损害他人合法权益的无效（第154条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c154"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maliciousCollusion"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmsOthersRights"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c157"><lrml:Comment>因该行为取得的财产应当返还；不能返还的折价补偿（第157条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c157"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ineffective"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obtainedPropertyUnder"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c157-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>因该行为取得的财产应当返还；不能返还的折价补偿</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnOrCompensateValue"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-revocable-valid"><lrml:Comment>可撤销的行为在被撤销前有效（第147条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revocable-valid"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c-revocation-right"><lrml:Comment>有撤销事由的，享有撤销权（形成权，须向法院或仲裁机构请求）（第147条、第148条、第149条、第150条、第151条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revocation-right"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c-revocation-right-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c147"><lrml:Comment>基于重大误解实施的，行为人有权请求撤销（第147条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c147"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:majorMisunderstanding"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c148"><lrml:Comment>一方欺诈的，受欺诈方有权请求撤销（第148条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c148"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deceivedByCounterparty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c149"><lrml:Comment>第三人欺诈，对方知道或应当知道的，受欺诈方有权请求撤销（第149条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c149"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deceivedByThirdParty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyKnewOrShouldKnowFraud"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c150"><lrml:Comment>一方或者第三人胁迫的，受胁迫方有权请求撤销（第三人胁迫不问相对人是否知情）（第150条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c150"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coercedByCounterparty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coercedByThirdParty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:duressCase"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c151"><lrml:Comment>利用对方危困状态、缺乏判断能力等致显失公平的，受损害方有权请求撤销（第151条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c151"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exploitedDistressOrInexperience"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grosslyUnfairAtFormation"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c-revoke-against"><lrml:Comment>撤销权针对的是撤销权人与相对人之间的民事法律行为，只能向该行为的相对人主张（实施欺诈、胁迫的第三人不是撤销对象）（第148条、第149条、第150条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revoke-against"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyOf"/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c-revoke-against-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeAgainst"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-revoked"><lrml:Comment>撤销权人在除斥期间内行使撤销权的，行为被撤销（第147条、第155条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revoked"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisesRevocation"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-1-1"><lrml:Comment>自知道或应当知道撤销事由之日起一年内没有行使的，撤销权消灭（第152条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-1-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:oneYearSinceKnewGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:majorMisunderstanding"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:duressCase"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-1-1m"><lrml:Comment>重大误解的当事人自知道或应当知道撤销事由之日起九十日内没有行使的，撤销权消灭（第152条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-1-1m"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:majorMisunderstanding"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ninetyDaysSinceKnewGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-1-2"><lrml:Comment>受胁迫，自胁迫行为终止之日起一年内没有行使的，撤销权消灭（第152条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-1-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:duressCase"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:oneYearSinceDuressEnded"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-1-3"><lrml:Comment>知道撤销事由后明确表示或者以自己的行为表明放弃撤销权的，撤销权消灭（第152条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-1-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:waivedRevocation"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-2"><lrml:Comment>自民事法律行为发生之日起五年内没有行使的，撤销权消灭（最长期间）（第152条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fiveYearsSinceAct"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c145-pure"><lrml:Comment>限制民事行为能力人实施的纯获利益或与其年龄、智力相适应的行为有效（第145条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c145-pure"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pureBenefit"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ageAppropriate"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c145-consent"><lrml:Comment>其他行为经法定代理人同意或者追认后有效（第145条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c145-consent"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianConsents"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianRatifies"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c145-pending"><lrml:Comment>同意或追认前效力待定（第145条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c145-pending"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pureBenefit"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ageAppropriate"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianConsents"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianRatifies"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ratificationRefused"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pendingValidity"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c145-refused"><lrml:Comment>拒绝追认的，确定不发生效力（第145条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c145-refused"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ratificationRefused"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pureBenefit"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ageAppropriate"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ineffective"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c145-deemed-refusal"><lrml:Comment>法定代理人收到催告三十日内未作表示的，视为拒绝追认（第145条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c145-deemed-refusal"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandedRatification"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAnswerWithin30Days"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianRatifies"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ratificationRefused"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c145-revoke"><lrml:Comment>追认前，善意相对人有撤销的权利（第145条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c145-revoke"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pendingValidity"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inGoodFaith"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c145-revoke-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeRight"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1812"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：追认的形成权 ⊑ 被代理人的追认权和拒绝权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1812"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>追认的形成权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>被代理人的追认权和拒绝权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1814"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：拒绝的形成权 ⊑ 被代理人的追认权和拒绝权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1814"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>拒绝的形成权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>被代理人的追认权和拒绝权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1861"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：委托代理的终止 ⊑ 代理终止</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1861"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>委托代理的终止</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>代理终止</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g1881"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：法定代理的终止 ⊑ 代理终止</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g1881"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法定代理的终止</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>代理终止</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c192-1"><lrml:Comment>诉讼时效期间届满的，义务人可以提出不履行义务的抗辩（抗辩权发生主义）（第192条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c192-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c192-1-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationDefense"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c192-2a"><lrml:Comment>届满后义务人同意履行的，不得以诉讼时效期间届满为由抗辩（第192条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c192-2a"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedToPerformAfterExpiry"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationDefense"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c192-2b"><lrml:Comment>届满后义务人已经自愿履行的，不得请求返还（第192条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c192-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyPerformed"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:restitutionClaim"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c193"><lrml:Comment>人民法院不得主动适用诉讼时效的规定（第193条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c193"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtHears"/><ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c193-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>人民法院不得主动适用诉讼时效的规定</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyLimitationExOfficio"/><ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c196"><lrml:Comment>停止侵害、排除妨碍、消除危险，不动产及登记动产物权人请求返还，抚养费赡养费扶养费等不适用诉讼时效（第196条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c196"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seeksCessationOrRemoval"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnOfImmovableOrRegisteredMovable"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportOrMaintenancePayment"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:statutorilyExempt"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptFromLimitation"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c188-20y"><lrml:Comment>自权利受到损害之日起超过二十年的，人民法院不予保护；有特殊情况的可以延长（第188条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c188-20y"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twentyYearsSinceDamage"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtExtends"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptFromLimitation"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notProtectedByCourt"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c188-run"><lrml:Comment>自知道或应当知道权利受损害及义务人之日起满三年，诉讼时效期间届满（第188条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c188-run"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:threeYearsSinceKnew"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationInterrupted"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationSuspended"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptFromLimitation"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c194"><lrml:Comment>最后六个月内因法定障碍不能行使请求权的，诉讼时效中止（第194条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c194"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:withinLastSixMonths"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forceMajeure"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableClaimantWithoutAgent"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirOrAdministratorUndetermined"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimantControlledByObligor"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherObstacle"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationSuspended"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c195"><lrml:Comment>权利人请求履行、义务人同意履行、起诉或申请仲裁等，诉讼时效中断、重新计算（第195条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c195"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorDemandsPerformance"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorAgreesToPerform"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suitOrArbitrationFiled"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:equivalentProceeding"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationInterrupted"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2094"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：平等保护原则 ⊑ 物权法的基本原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2094"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>平等保护原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物权法的基本原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2102"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：物权客体特定原则 ⊑ 物权法的基本原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2102"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物权客体特定原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物权法的基本原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2108"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：物权法定原则 ⊑ 物权法的基本原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2108"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物权法定原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物权法的基本原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2250"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：简易交付 ⊑ 观念交付</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2250"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>简易交付</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>观念交付</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2255"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：指示交付 ⊑ 观念交付</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2255"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>指示交付</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>观念交付</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2314"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：首次登记 ⊑ 变动登记</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2314"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>首次登记</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>变动登记</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2316"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：变更登记 ⊑ 变动登记</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2316"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>变更登记</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>变动登记</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g2318"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：转移登记 ⊑ 变动登记</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g2318"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>转移登记</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>变动登记</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
