                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c374"><lrml:Comment>地役权自地役权合同生效时设立（第374条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c374"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c374-oppose"><lrml:Comment>未经登记，不得对抗善意第三人（第374条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c374-oppose"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquirerOfServientLand"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inGoodFaith"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementOpposableTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c374-oppose-def"><lrml:Comment>地役权对供役地受让人有约束力（第383条）（第374条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c374-oppose-def"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquirerOfServientLand"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementOpposableTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c380-for"><lrml:Comment>地役权不得单独转让（第380条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c380-for"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementHolder"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c380-for-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>地役权不得单独转让</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferEasementSeparately"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c380-follow"><lrml:Comment>需役地上的用益物权转让的，地役权一并转让，但是合同另有约定的除外（第380条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c380-follow"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dominantLandRightTransferred"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractProvidesOtherwise"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementTransfersTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c381-for"><lrml:Comment>地役权不得单独抵押（第381条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c381-for"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementHolder"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c381-for-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>地役权不得单独抵押</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEasementSeparately"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c381-follow"><lrml:Comment>需役地上的用益物权抵押的，实现抵押权时地役权一并转让（第381条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c381-follow"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dominantLandRightMortgageRealized"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementTransfersTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c407-for"><lrml:Comment>抵押权不得与债权分离而单独转让或者作为其他债权的担保（第407条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c407-for"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c407-for-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>抵押权不得与债权分离而单独转让或者作为其他债权的担保</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferMortgageSeparately"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c407-follow"><lrml:Comment>债权转让的，担保该债权的抵押权一并转让；法律另有规定或当事人另有约定的除外（第407条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c407-follow"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAssigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedMortgageNotFollow"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageTransfersTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3230"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：法定担保物权 ⊑ 担保物权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3230"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法定担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3231"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：约定担保物权 ⊑ 担保物权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3231"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>约定担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3233"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：动产担保物权 ⊑ 担保物权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3233"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>动产担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3234"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：不动产担保物权 ⊑ 担保物权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3234"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>不动产担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3235"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：权利担保物权 ⊑ 担保物权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3235"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>权利担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>担保物权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-oppose-default"><lrml:Comment>已设立的抵押权可以对抗取得抵押财产的第三人（追及效力）（第403条、第406条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-oppose-default"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thirdPartyAcquirer"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageOpposableTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c395"><lrml:Comment>债务人或第三人有权处分的、法律未禁止抵押的财产可以抵押（第395条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c395"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasDisposalPower"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonMortgageable"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageObjectOk"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c399"><lrml:Comment>土地所有权、集体土地使用权（法律另有规定除外）、公益设施、权属争议、被查封扣押监管的财产不得抵押（第399条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c399"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landOwnership"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:collectiveLandUseRight"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawPermitsMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:publicWelfareFacility"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disputedOwnership"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seizedOrSupervised"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageBannedByLaw"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonMortgageable"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c402-type"><lrml:Comment>以建筑物、建设用地使用权、海域使用权、正在建造的建筑物抵押的，应当办理抵押登记（第402条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c402-type"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:building"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionLandUseRight"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seaAreaUseRight"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buildingUnderConstruction"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:registrationConstitutive"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c402"><lrml:Comment>不动产抵押：抵押权自登记时设立（第402条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c402"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageObjectOk"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:registrationConstitutive"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c402-noreg"><lrml:Comment>应当登记而未登记的，抵押权不设立（抵押合同效力不受影响，第215条）（第402条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c402-noreg"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:registrationConstitutive"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c403"><lrml:Comment>动产抵押：抵押权自抵押合同生效时设立（第403条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c403"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageObjectOk"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:movable"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c403-oppose"><lrml:Comment>动产抵押未经登记，不得对抗善意第三人（第403条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c403-oppose"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:movable"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thirdPartyAcquirer"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inGoodFaith"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageOpposableTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c404"><lrml:Comment>动产抵押（不论是否登记）不得对抗正常经营活动中已支付合理价款并取得抵押财产的买受人（第404条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c404"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:movable"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thirdPartyAcquirer"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ordinaryCourseBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidReasonablePrice"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredProperty"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageOpposableTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c401"><lrml:Comment>流押条款：只能依法就抵押财产优先受偿（第401条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c401"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forfeitureClauseBeforeMaturity"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forfeitureEffective"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorityPaymentOnly"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3320"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：抵押人的权利和义务 ⊑ 当事人的权利和义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3320"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>抵押人的权利和义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>当事人的权利和义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3326"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：抵押权人的权利和义务 ⊑ 当事人的权利和义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3326"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>抵押权人的权利和义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>当事人的权利和义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c405"><lrml:Comment>抵押权设立前已出租并转移占有的，原租赁关系不受抵押权影响（第405条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c405"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leasedAndPossessedBeforeMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseUnaffectedByMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c406-perm"><lrml:Comment>抵押期间，抵押人可以转让抵押财产；当事人另有约定的，按照其约定（第406条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c406-perm"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedNoTransfer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="c406-perm-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>抵押期间，抵押人可以转让抵押财产；当事人另有约定的，按照其约定</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferMortgagedProperty"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c406-early"><lrml:Comment>能够证明转让可能损害抵押权的，可以请求以转让价款提前清偿或者提存（第406条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c406-early"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transfersProperty"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferMayHarmMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c406-early-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandEarlyPaymentOrEscrow"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c406-notify"><lrml:Comment>抵押人转让抵押财产的，应当及时通知抵押权人（第406条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c406-notify"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transfersProperty"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c406-notify-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>抵押人转让抵押财产的，应当及时通知抵押权人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyMortgagee"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c420-in"><lrml:Comment>一定期间内连续发生的债权，在最高债权额限度内受担保（第420条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c420-in"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxAmountMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimArisesInPeriod"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesAfterDetermination"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c420-pre"><lrml:Comment>设立前已存在的债权，经当事人同意可以转入最高额抵押担保范围（第420条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c420-pre"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxAmountMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preExistingClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partiesAgreeToInclude"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c423"><lrml:Comment>约定期间届满、无约定满二年请求确定、不可能发生新债权、知道查封扣押、破产解散等，债权确定（第423条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c423"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxAmountMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedDeterminationPeriodExpired"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedPeriod"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twoYearsSinceEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:determinationRequested"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noNewClaimPossible"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageeKnowsSeizure"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtorOrMortgagorBankruptOrDissolved"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaimsDetermined"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c423-after"><lrml:Comment>债权确定后发生的债权不再受最高额抵押担保（第423条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c423-after"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaimsDetermined"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesAfterDetermination"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c421"><lrml:Comment>最高额抵押担保的债权确定前，部分债权转让的，最高额抵押权不得转让；当事人另有约定的除外（第421条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c421"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxAmountMortgage"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAssigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaimsDetermined"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedMortgageFollows"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageTransfersTo"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c428"><lrml:Comment>履行期届满前约定不履行时质押财产归债权人所有的，只能依法就质押财产优先受偿（第428条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c428"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pledgeContract"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forfeitureClauseBeforeMaturity"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forfeitureEffective"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorityPaymentOnly"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c456"><lrml:Comment>同一动产上已设立抵押权或者质权，该动产又被留置的，留置权人优先受偿（第456条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c456"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienRight"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sameCollateralSecurity"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienRanksFirst"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c447"><lrml:Comment>债务人不履行到期债务，债权人可以留置已经合法占有的债务人的动产；动产应当与债权属于同一法律关系，企业之间留置的除外（第448条）（第447条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c447"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtMatured"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unpaid"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawfullyPossesses"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:movable"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:belongsTo"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sameLegalRelation"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:betweenEnterprises"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienRight"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c447-priority"><lrml:Comment>留置权人有权就该动产优先受偿（第447条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c447-priority"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienRight"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c447-priority-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorityFromLien"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c449"><lrml:Comment>法律规定或者当事人约定不得留置的动产，不得留置（第449条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c449"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawfullyPossesses"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienExcludedByLaw"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienExcludedByAgreement"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienRight"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c414-1"><lrml:Comment>均已登记的，按登记先后确定清偿顺序（第414条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c414-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sameCollateral"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:registeredEarlier"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ranksBefore"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c414-2"><lrml:Comment>已登记的先于未登记的受偿（第414条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c414-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sameCollateral"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ranksBefore"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c414-3"><lrml:Comment>均未登记的，按债权比例清偿（第414条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c414-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sameCollateral"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageRegistered"/><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidProRata"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c415"><lrml:Comment>同一财产既抵押又出质的，按登记、交付的时间先后确定清偿顺序（第415条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c415"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sameCollateral"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageVsPledge"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:perfectedEarlier"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ranksBefore"/><ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3589"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：按份共同保证 ⊑ 共同保证</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3589"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>按份共同保证</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>共同保证</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3593"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：连带共同保证 ⊑ 共同保证</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3593"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>连带共同保证</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>共同保证</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
