          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3694"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：请求权能 ⊑ 债权的权能</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3694"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>请求权能</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>债权的权能</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
