                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3804"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：从属性 ⊑ 特性</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3804"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>从属性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>特性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3806"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：补充性 ⊑ 特性</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3806"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>补充性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>特性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3808"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：相对独立性 ⊑ 特性</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3808"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>相对独立性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>特性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g3810"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：明确的目的性 ⊑ 特性</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g3810"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>明确的目的性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>特性</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c476"><lrml:Comment>要约可以撤销；明示不可撤销或受要约人有理由信赖并已做合理准备的除外（第476条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c476"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:offer"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:statedIrrevocable"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:offereeReliedAndPrepared"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c476-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeOffer"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c525"><lrml:Comment>没有先后履行顺序的，一方在对方履行之前有权拒绝其履行请求（第525条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c525"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutualDebts"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noPerformanceOrder"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performed"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c525-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:simultaneousPerformanceDefense"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c526"><lrml:Comment>应当先履行的一方未履行的，后履行一方有权拒绝其履行请求（第526条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c526"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutualDebts"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performsFirst"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performed"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c526-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subsequentPerformanceDefense"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c527"><lrml:Comment>先履行一方有确切证据证明对方经营状况严重恶化等情形的，可以中止履行（第527条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c527"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutualDebts"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performsFirst"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:conclusiveEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:businessSeverelyDeteriorated"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assetsTransferredToEvadeDebt"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lostCommercialCredibility"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayLoseAbilityToPerform"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c527-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:insecurityDefense"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c527-2"><lrml:Comment>没有确切证据中止履行的，应当承担违约责任（第527条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c527-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutualDebts"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suspendsPerformance"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:conclusiveEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableForBreach"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c528-notify"><lrml:Comment>依法中止履行的，应当及时通知对方（第528条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c528-notify"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:insecurityDefense"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suspendsPerformance"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c528-notify-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>依法中止履行的，应当及时通知对方</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyCounterparty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c528-resume"><lrml:Comment>对方提供适当担保的，应当恢复履行（第528条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c528-resume"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutualDebts"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performsFirst"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:conclusiveEvidence"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adequateSecurityProvided"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:insecurityDefense"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c528-term"><lrml:Comment>对方在合理期限内未恢复履行能力且未提供适当担保的，可以解除合同并请求违约责任（第528条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c528-term"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:insecurityDefense"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutualDebts"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noRecoveryWithinReasonableTime"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adequateSecurityProvided"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationRight"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableForBreach"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c547"><lrml:Comment>受让人取得与债权有关的从权利（专属于债权人自身的除外；不因未办理转移登记或未转移占有而受影响）（第547条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c547"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assignmentEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accessoryRightOf"/><ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalToCreditor"/><ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiresAccessoryRight"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c545"><lrml:Comment>债权人可以将债权转让给第三人（性质、约定、法律不得转让的除外）（第545条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c545"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAssigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonAssignableByNature"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonAssignableByLaw"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedNonAssignable"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assignmentEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c545-2-money"><lrml:Comment>约定金钱债权不得转让的，不得对抗第三人（第545条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c545-2-money"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAssigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedNonAssignable"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:monetaryClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonAssignableByNature"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonAssignableByLaw"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assignmentEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c545-2-goodfaith"><lrml:Comment>约定非金钱债权不得转让的，不得对抗善意第三人（第545条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c545-2-goodfaith"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAssigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedNonAssignable"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:monetaryClaim"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inGoodFaith"/><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonAssignableByNature"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonAssignableByLaw"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assignmentEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c546"><lrml:Comment>债权人转让债权，未通知债务人的，该转让对债务人不发生效力（第546条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c546"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assignmentEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAssigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtorNotified"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bindsDebtor"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c546-def"><lrml:Comment>通知债务人后，转让对债务人发生效力（第546条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c546-def"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assignmentEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtorNotified"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bindsDebtor"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g4477"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：免责的债务承担 ⊑ 债务承担</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g4477"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>免责的债务承担</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>债务承担</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g4496"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：并存的债务承担 ⊑ 债务承担</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g4496"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>并存的债务承担</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>债务承担</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c551"><lrml:Comment>债务人将债务转移给第三人的，应当经债权人同意（第551条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c551"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtTransfer"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorConsents"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtTransferEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c551-ok"><lrml:Comment>经债权人同意的，债务转移有效（第551条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c551-ok"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtTransfer"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorConsents"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtTransferEffective"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c551-2"><lrml:Comment>催告后债权人未作表示的，视为不同意（第551条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c551-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtTransfer"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandedConsent"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorSilent"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorConsents"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g4593"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：约定解除 ⊑ 单方解除</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g4593"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>约定解除</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>单方解除</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g4596"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：法定解除 ⊑ 单方解除</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g4596"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法定解除</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>单方解除</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c585-3"><lrml:Comment>就迟延履行约定违约金的，违约方支付违约金后，还应当履行债务（第585条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c585-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liquidatedDamagesForDelay"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachingParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidLD"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c585-3-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>就迟延履行约定违约金的，违约方支付违约金后，还应当履行债务</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stillPerform"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c585-reduce"><lrml:Comment>约定的违约金过分高于造成的损失的，可以根据当事人的请求予以适当减少（第585条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c585-reduce"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liquidatedDamages"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessivelyHigherThanLoss"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partyRequestsAdjustment"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtMayReduceLD"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c585-increase"><lrml:Comment>约定的违约金低于造成的损失的，可以根据当事人的请求予以增加（第585条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c585-increase"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liquidatedDamages"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lowerThanLoss"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partyRequestsAdjustment"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtMayIncreaseLD"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c586"><lrml:Comment>定金合同自实际交付定金时成立（实践合同）（第586条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c586"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositAgreed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositActuallyPaid"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositContractFormed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c586-cap"><lrml:Comment>定金不得超过主合同标的额的百分之二十，超过部分不产生定金的效力（第586条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c586-cap"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositContractFormed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceeds20PercentOfSubject"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessNotDeposit"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c587-payer"><lrml:Comment>给付定金的一方根本违约的，无权请求返还定金（第587条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c587-payer"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositContractFormed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositPayer"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachFrustratesPurpose"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositRefundClaim"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c587-receiver"><lrml:Comment>收受定金的一方根本违约的，应当双倍返还定金（第587条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c587-receiver"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositContractFormed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositReceiver"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositPayer"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachFrustratesPurpose"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c587-receiver-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>收受定金的一方根本违约的，应当双倍返还定金</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnDoubleDeposit"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c588-choice"><lrml:Comment>既约定违约金又约定定金的，对方可以选择适用违约金或者定金条款（第588条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c588-choice"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liquidatedDamages"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositContractFormed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonBreachingParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c588-choice-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:chooseLDOrDeposit"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c588-nocumul"><lrml:Comment>违约金与定金不能并用（第588条“选择适用”）（第588条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c588-nocumul"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liquidatedDamages"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositContractFormed"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonBreachingParty"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="c588-nocumul-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>违约金与定金不能并用（第588条“选择适用”）</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimBothLDAndDeposit"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g4889"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：权利瑕疵担保 ⊑ 瑕疵担保</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g4889"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>权利瑕疵担保</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>瑕疵担保</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g4897"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：质量瑕疵担保 ⊑ 瑕疵担保</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g4897"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>质量瑕疵担保</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>瑕疵担保</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c604-before"><lrml:Comment>标的物风险在交付之前由出卖人承担（第604条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c604-before"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delivered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c604-after"><lrml:Comment>交付之后由买受人承担（第604条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c604-after"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delivered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c605"><lrml:Comment>因买受人原因致使标的物未按约定期限交付的，买受人自违反约定时起承担风险（第605条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c605"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerCausedDeliveryDelay"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c607-1"><lrml:Comment>按约定运送至买受人指定地点并交付承运人后，风险由买受人承担（第607条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c607-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carriageToBuyerDesignatedPlace"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:handedToCarrier"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c607-2"><lrml:Comment>没有约定交付地点、需要运输的，交付给第一承运人后风险由买受人承担（第607条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c607-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedDeliveryPlace"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsCarriage"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:handedToFirstCarrier"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c608"><lrml:Comment>置于交付地点，买受人违反约定没有收取的，风险自违反约定时起由买受人承担（第608条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c608"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:placedAtDeliveryPoint"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerFailedToCollect"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c610"><lrml:Comment>因质量不符致不能实现合同目的，买受人拒收或解除合同的，风险由出卖人承担（第610条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c610"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:qualityDefectFrustratesPurpose"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerRejectsGoods"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerTerminates"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c604-agreed"><lrml:Comment>当事人另有约定的除外（第604条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c604-agreed"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskAgreedOnSeller"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c226-delivery"><lrml:Comment>买受人已经占有标的物的（如借用、租赁中买下），买卖合同生效时视为交付（简易交付），风险随之转移（第226条、第604条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c226-delivery"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerAlreadyPossesses"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delivered"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c604-price"><lrml:Comment>风险由买受人承担的，标的物意外毁损灭失后，买受人仍须支付价款（第604条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c604-price"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:goodsPerished"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c604-price-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>风险由买受人承担的，标的物意外毁损灭失后，买受人仍须支付价款</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payPrice"/><ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5143"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：提供真实情况的义务 ⊑ 借款人的主要义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5143"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>提供真实情况的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>借款人的主要义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5149"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：按期支付利息的义务 ⊑ 借款人的主要义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5149"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>按期支付利息的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>借款人的主要义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5151"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：按期返还借款的义务 ⊑ 借款人的主要义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5151"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>按期返还借款的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>借款人的主要义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5287"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：适租义务 ⊑ 出租人的义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5287"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>适租义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>出租人的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5289"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：瑕疵担保义务 ⊑ 出租人的义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5289"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>瑕疵担保义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>出租人的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5291"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：维修义务 ⊑ 出租人的义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5291"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>维修义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>出租人的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c725"><lrml:Comment>承租人依约占有期间租赁物所有权变动的，不影响租赁合同的效力（第725条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c725"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantPossessesUnderLease"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownershipChanged"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseBindsNewOwner"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5323"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：合法转租 ⊑ 转租</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5323"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>合法转租</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>转租</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5328"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：非法转租 ⊑ 转租</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5328"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>非法转租</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>转租</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c726"><lrml:Comment>出租人出卖租赁房屋的，承租人享有以同等条件优先购买的权利；按份共有人行使优先购买权或出卖给近亲属的除外（第726条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c726"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordSells"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coOwnerExercisesPreemption"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:saleToCloseRelative"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c726-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preemptionRight"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c726-notify"><lrml:Comment>出租人应当在出卖之前的合理期限内通知承租人（第726条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c726-notify"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordOf"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordSells"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c726-notify-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>出租人应当在出卖之前的合理期限内通知承租人</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyTenantBeforeSale"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c726-2"><lrml:Comment>出租人履行通知义务后，承租人在十五日内未明确表示购买的，视为放弃优先购买权（第726条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c726-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/><ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantNotifiedOfSale"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAnswerWithin15Days"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preemptionRight"/><ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5372"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：交付租赁物的义务 ⊑ 出租人的义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5372"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>交付租赁物的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>出租人的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5374"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：向出卖人付款的义务 ⊑ 出租人的义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5374"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>向出卖人付款的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>出租人的义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5553"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：客运合同 ⊑ 运输合同</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5553"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>客运合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>运输合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5575"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：货运合同 ⊑ 运输合同</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5575"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>货运合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>运输合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5598"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：多式联运合同 ⊑ 运输合同</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5598"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>多式联运合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>运输合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5611"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：委托开发合同 ⊑ 技术开发合同</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5611"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>委托开发合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>技术开发合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5622"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：合作开发合同 ⊑ 技术开发合同</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5622"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>合作开发合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>技术开发合同</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5693"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：告知义务 ⊑ 寄存人的主要义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5693"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>告知义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>寄存人的主要义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g5696"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：声明义务 ⊑ 寄存人的主要义务</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g5696"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>声明义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>寄存人的主要义务</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
