                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1062"><lrml:Comment>婚姻关系存续期间所得的工资、经营投资收益、知识产权收益、继承或受赠的财产等为夫妻共同财产（第1062条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1062"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredDuringMarriage"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wagesOrRemuneration"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:businessOrInvestmentIncome"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ipIncome"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritedOrGifted"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherCommonProperty"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:communityProperty"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1063"><lrml:Comment>婚前财产、人身损害赔偿或补偿、遗嘱或赠与合同中确定只归一方的财产、一方专用生活用品为个人财产（第1063条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1063"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:premaritalProperty"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalInjuryCompensation"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedSolelyToOneSpouse"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalUseItem"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherSeparateProperty"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:separateProperty"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:communityProperty"/><ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6625"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：一方的婚前财产 ⊑ 夫妻个人特有财产</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6625"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>一方的婚前财产</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>夫妻个人特有财产</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6629"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：其他应当归一方的财产 ⊑ 夫妻个人特有财产</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6629"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>其他应当归一方的财产</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>夫妻个人特有财产</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6710"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：登记离婚 ⊑ 离婚</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6710"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>登记离婚</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>离婚</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6724"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：诉讼离婚 ⊑ 离婚</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6724"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>诉讼离婚</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>离婚</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6746"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：对军人婚姻的特殊保护 ⊑ 诉讼离婚的特殊保护</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6746"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>对军人婚姻的特殊保护</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>诉讼离婚的特殊保护</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6748"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：对女方的特殊保护 ⊑ 诉讼离婚的特殊保护</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6748"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>对女方的特殊保护</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>诉讼离婚的特殊保护</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-joint"><lrml:Comment>共同签名或一方事后追认等共同意思表示所负的债务，属于夫妻共同债务（第1064条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-joint"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bothSigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRatified"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-daily"><lrml:Comment>一方在婚姻关系存续期间以个人名义为家庭日常生活需要所负的债务，属于夫妻共同债务（第1064条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-daily"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incurredDuringMarriage"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inOwnName"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forDailyHouseholdNeeds"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-2"><lrml:Comment>超出家庭日常生活需要所负的债务，不属于夫妻共同债务；但债权人能证明用于共同生活、共同生产经营或基于共同意思表示的除外（第1064条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incurredDuringMarriage"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inOwnName"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsDailyNeeds"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bothSigned"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRatified"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorProvesCommonUse"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-2-proof"><lrml:Comment>债权人能够证明用于夫妻共同生活、共同生产经营或基于共同意思表示的，属于共同债务（第1064条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-2-proof"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorProvesCommonUse"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/><ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6830"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：其他重大过错 ⊑ 法定过错</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6830"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>其他重大过错</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法定过错</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6850"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：被收养人的条件 ⊑ 收养关系成立的实质条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6850"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>被收养人的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>收养关系成立的实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6855"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：送养人的条件 ⊑ 收养关系成立的实质条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6855"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>送养人的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>收养关系成立的实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g6862"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：收养人的条件 ⊑ 收养关系成立的实质条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g6862"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>收养人的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>收养关系成立的实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1125"><lrml:Comment>故意杀害被继承人、为争夺遗产杀害其他继承人、遗弃或严重虐待、伪造篡改隐匿销毁遗嘱、欺诈胁迫影响遗嘱等，丧失继承权（第1125条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1125"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:killedDeceased"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:killedCoHeirForEstate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:abandonedOrSeriouslyAbused"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forgedOrDestroyedWillSeriously"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coercedWillSeriously"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1125-2"><lrml:Comment>有第三至五项行为，确有悔改表现，被继承人表示宽恕或在遗嘱中将其列为继承人的，不丧失继承权（第一、二项不可宽恕）（第1125条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1125-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:abandonedOrSeriouslyAbused"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forgedOrDestroyedWillSeriously"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coercedWillSeriously"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:killedDeceased"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:killedCoHeirForEstate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:repented"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forgivenByDeceased"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:namedInLaterWill"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1123-intestate"><lrml:Comment>继承开始后，按照法定继承办理（第1123条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1123-intestate"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportAgreementCovers"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:effectiveWillCovers"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1127-child"><lrml:Comment>子女包括婚生子女、非婚生子女、养子女和有扶养关系的继子女（第1127条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1127-child"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:biologicalChild"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adoptedChild"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stepchildWithSupport"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1127-parent"><lrml:Comment>父母包括生父母、养父母和有扶养关系的继父母（第1127条第4款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1127-parent"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:biologicalParent"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adoptiveParent"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stepparentWithSupport"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-heir-cand"><lrml:Comment>配偶、子女、父母、兄弟姐妹、祖父母、外祖父母为法定继承人（第1127条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-heir-cand"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:secondOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1127-first"><lrml:Comment>第一顺序：配偶、子女、父母（第1127条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1127-first"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1129"><lrml:Comment>丧偶儿媳对公婆、丧偶女婿对岳父母尽了主要赡养义务的，作为第一顺序继承人（第1129条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1129"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:widowedInLaw"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mainSupportDutyFulfilled"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1127-2-first"><lrml:Comment>继承开始后，由第一顺序继承人继承（第1127条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1127-2-first"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:predeceased"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renounced"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsIntestate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderInherits"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1127-second"><lrml:Comment>第二顺序：兄弟姐妹、祖父母、外祖父母（第1127条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1127-second"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:siblingOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grandparentOf"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:secondOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1127-2-second"><lrml:Comment>没有第一顺序继承人继承的，由第二顺序继承人继承（第1127条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1127-2-second"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:secondOrderHeir"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:predeceased"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renounced"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderInherits"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsIntestate"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1128-1"><lrml:Comment>被继承人的子女先于被继承人死亡的，由子女的直系晚辈血亲代位继承（第1128条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1128-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:predeceased"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lineaDescendant"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsBySubrogation"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderInherits"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1128-2"><lrml:Comment>兄弟姐妹先于被继承人死亡的，由兄弟姐妹的子女代位继承（属第二顺序）（第1128条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1128-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:siblingOf"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:predeceased"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/><ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:firstOrderInherits"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsBySubrogation"/><ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1123-will"><lrml:Comment>有遗嘱的，按照遗嘱继承或者遗赠办理（第1123条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1123-will"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:effectiveWillCovers"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportAgreementCovers"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byWill"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-will-effective"><lrml:Comment>有效且未被撤回的遗嘱就其处分的遗产适用遗嘱继承（第1123条、第1142条第3款、第1143条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-will-effective"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willCoversEstate"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supersededWill"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:effectiveWillCovers"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1143-1"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力人或者限制民事行为能力人所立的遗嘱无效（第1143条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1143-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1143-2"><lrml:Comment>受欺诈、胁迫所立的遗嘱无效（第1143条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1143-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willByFraud"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willByDuress"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1143-3"><lrml:Comment>伪造的遗嘱无效（第1143条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1143-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forgedWill"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1142-2"><lrml:Comment>立遗嘱后实施与遗嘱内容相反的民事法律行为的，视为对遗嘱相关内容的撤回（第1142条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1142-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contraryActAfterWill"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supersededWill"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1142-3"><lrml:Comment>立有数份遗嘱，内容相抵触的，以最后的遗嘱为准（第1142条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1142-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/><ruleml:Var>W2</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:conflictingWills"/><ruleml:Var>W1</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>W2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:madeLater"/><ruleml:Var>W2</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>W1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/><ruleml:Var>W2</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supersededWill"/><ruleml:Var>W1</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1123-agreement"><lrml:Comment>有遗赠扶养协议的，按照协议办理（效力最优先）（第1123条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1123-agreement"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportAgreementCovers"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byAgreement"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7306"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：先遗嘱继承后法定继承原则 ⊑ 遗产分割的原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7306"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>先遗嘱继承后法定继承原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>遗产分割的原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7308"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：保留胎儿继承份额原则 ⊑ 遗产分割的原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7308"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>保留胎儿继承份额原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>遗产分割的原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7316"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：物尽其用原则 ⊑ 遗产分割的原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7316"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物尽其用原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>遗产分割的原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7344"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：限定继承原则 ⊑ 被继承人债务清偿的原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7344"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>限定继承原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>被继承人债务清偿的原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7348"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：保留必留份原则 ⊑ 被继承人债务清偿的原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7348"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>保留必留份原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>被继承人债务清偿的原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7350"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：连带责任原则 ⊑ 被继承人债务清偿的原则</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7350"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>连带责任原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>被继承人债务清偿的原则</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c-liable-obl"><lrml:Comment>承担侵权责任的，应当向被侵权人赔偿损失（第1165条第1款、第179条；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-liable-obl"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c-liable-obl-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>承担侵权责任的，应当向被侵权人赔偿损失</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:compensate"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1165-1"><lrml:Comment>行为人因过错侵害他人民事权益造成损害的，应当承担侵权责任（第1165条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1165-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causation"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1165-2"><lrml:Comment>依法推定有过错，不能证明自己没有过错的，应当承担侵权责任（第1165条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1165-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:faultPresumedByLaw"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causation"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNoFault"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7467"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：一般过失 ⊑ 过失</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7467"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>一般过失</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>过失</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7470"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：重大过失 ⊑ 过失</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7470"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>重大过失</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>过失</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1188"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人造成他人损害的，由监护人承担侵权责任（无过错责任）（第1188条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1188"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1188-reduce"><lrml:Comment>监护人尽到监护职责的，可以减轻其侵权责任（第1188条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1188-reduce"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDutyFulfilled"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liabilityMayBeReduced"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1188-2"><lrml:Comment>有财产的，从本人财产中支付赔偿费用；不足部分由监护人赔偿（第1188条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1188-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasOwnProperty"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidFromWardsProperty"/><ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianPaysShortfall"/><ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7596"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：用人单位责任 ⊑ 用人者责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7596"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>用人单位责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>用人者责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7611"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：个人劳务使用人责任 ⊑ 用人者责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7611"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>个人劳务使用人责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>用人者责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1191-1"><lrml:Comment>工作人员因执行工作任务造成他人损害的，由用人单位承担侵权责任（替代责任）（第1191条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employeeOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performingDuties"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchedWorker"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1191-recourse"><lrml:Comment>用人单位承担侵权责任后，可以向有故意或者重大过失的工作人员追偿（第1191条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-recourse"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employeeOf"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performingDuties"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentional"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grossNegligence"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c1191-recourse-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1191-2"><lrml:Comment>劳务派遣期间，由接受劳务派遣的用工单位承担侵权责任（第1191条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchedWorker"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hostEmployer"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performingDuties"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1191-2b"><lrml:Comment>劳务派遣单位有过错的，承担相应的责任（第1191条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchedWorker"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchAgency"/><ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performingDuties"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/><ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/><ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:correspondingLiability"/><ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1199"><lrml:Comment>无民事行为能力人在教育机构受到人身损害的，教育机构承担责任；能证明尽到教育、管理职责的除外（过错推定）（第1199条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1199"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredAtSchool"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredByOutsider"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesDutyFulfilled"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1200"><lrml:Comment>限制民事行为能力人受到人身损害，教育机构未尽到教育、管理职责的，承担责任（过错责任，受害人举证）（第1200条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1200"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredAtSchool"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredByOutsider"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:schoolFailedDuty"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1201"><lrml:Comment>受到教育机构以外的第三人人身损害的，由第三人承担侵权责任（第1201条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1201"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredAtSchool"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredByOutsider"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:outsiderTortfeasor"/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1201-supp"><lrml:Comment>教育机构未尽到管理职责的，承担相应的补充责任，承担后可以向第三人追偿（第1201条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1201-supp"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredAtSchool"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:injuredByOutsider"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:schoolFailedDuty"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supplementaryLiability"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1202"><lrml:Comment>因产品存在缺陷造成他人损害的，生产者应当承担侵权责任（无过错责任）（第1202条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1202"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectiveProduct"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:producer"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damagedBy"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
        <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1203"><lrml:Comment>被侵权人可以向产品的生产者请求赔偿，也可以向产品的销售者请求赔偿（第1203条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1203"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectiveProduct"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seller"/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damagedBy"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c1203-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimCompensationFrom"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1203-p"><lrml:Comment>被侵权人可以向产品的生产者请求赔偿（第1203条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1203-p"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectiveProduct"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:producer"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damagedBy"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c1203-p-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimCompensationFrom"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1203-2a"><lrml:Comment>产品缺陷由生产者造成的，销售者赔偿后有权向生产者追偿（第1203条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1203-2a"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectiveProduct"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:producer"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seller"/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectCausedByProducer"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidVictim"/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c1203-2a-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1203-2b"><lrml:Comment>因销售者的过错使产品存在缺陷的，生产者赔偿后有权向销售者追偿（第1203条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1203-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectiveProduct"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:producer"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seller"/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectCausedBySellerFault"/><ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidVictim"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Right key="c1203-2b-h0"><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/><ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Right></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
        <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7838"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：共同侵权 ⊑ 数人侵权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7838"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>共同侵权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>数人侵权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7840"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：无意思联络的数人侵权 ⊑ 数人侵权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7840"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>无意思联络的数人侵权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>数人侵权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1245"><lrml:Comment>饲养的动物造成他人损害的，动物饲养人或者管理人应当承担侵权责任（无过错责任）（第1245条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1245"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1245-def"><lrml:Comment>能够证明损害是因被侵权人故意或者重大过失造成的，可以不承担或者减轻责任（第1245条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1245-def"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimGrossNegligence"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1246"><lrml:Comment>违反管理规定未采取安全措施的，被侵权人重大过失不再减免责任（第1246条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1246"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatedRulesNoSafetyMeasures"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1246-reduce"><lrml:Comment>违反管理规定的，只有被侵权人故意才可以减轻责任（不能免除）（第1246条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1246-reduce"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatedRulesNoSafetyMeasures"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayReduceOnly"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1247"><lrml:Comment>禁止饲养的烈性犬等危险动物造成他人损害的，应当承担侵权责任（无免责事由）（第1247条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1247"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bannedDangerousAnimal"/><ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayReduceOnly"/><ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1253"><lrml:Comment>建筑物等及其搁置物、悬挂物脱落、坠落造成损害，所有人、管理人或者使用人不能证明自己没有过错的，应当承担侵权责任（第1253条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1253"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fallingObjectFrom"/><ruleml:Var>Bd</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerManagerOrUser"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Bd</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNoFault"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1254-known"><lrml:Comment>从建筑物中抛掷物品或坠落物品造成他人损害的，由侵权人依法承担侵权责任（第1254条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-known"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectThrownOrFell"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:identifiedTortfeasor"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1254-unknown"><lrml:Comment>难以确定具体侵权人的，除能够证明自己不是侵权人的外，由可能加害的建筑物使用人给予补偿（第1254条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-unknown"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectThrownOrFell"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:possibleBuildingUser"/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortfeasorIdentified"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNotTortfeasor"/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="c1254-unknown-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>难以确定具体侵权人的，除能够证明自己不是侵权人的外，由可能加害的建筑物使用人给予补偿</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:slot><lrml:AuxiliaryParty/><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCompensationShare"/><ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1254-known-flag"><lrml:Comment>已查明具体侵权人（第1254条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-known-flag"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:identifiedTortfeasor"/><ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortfeasorIdentified"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1254-2"><lrml:Comment>物业服务企业等建筑物管理人未采取必要的安全保障措施的，承担未履行安全保障义务的侵权责任（第1254条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectThrownOrFell"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buildingManager"/><ruleml:Var>Pm</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noNecessarySafetyMeasures"/><ruleml:Var>Pm</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/><ruleml:Var>Pm</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7946"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：堆放物倒塌的致害责任 ⊑ 物件致人损害的责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7946"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>堆放物倒塌的致害责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物件致人损害的责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7948"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：妨碍通行物的致害责任 ⊑ 物件致人损害的责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7948"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>妨碍通行物的致害责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物件致人损害的责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7953"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：林木的致害责任 ⊑ 物件致人损害的责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7953"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>林木的致害责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物件致人损害的责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7955"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：地下设施的致害责任 ⊑ 物件致人损害的责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7955"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>地下设施的致害责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>物件致人损害的责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
          <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g7956"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：地面施工致人损害责任 ⊑ 地下设施的致害责任</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g7956"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>地面施工致人损害责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>地下设施的致害责任</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
