              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8157"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：摄制权 ⊑ 著作财产权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8157"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>摄制权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>著作财产权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8159"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：改编权 ⊑ 著作财产权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8159"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>改编权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>著作财产权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8163"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：翻译权 ⊑ 著作财产权</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8163"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>翻译权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>著作财产权</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8255"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：自己实施专利的权利 ⊑ 专利权人的权利</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8255"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>自己实施专利的权利</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>专利权人的权利</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8256"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：许可他人实施专利的权利 ⊑ 专利权人的权利</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8256"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>许可他人实施专利的权利</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>专利权人的权利</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8269"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：原始主体 ⊑ 商标权的主体</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8269"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>原始主体</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>商标权的主体</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-g8271"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：继受主体 ⊑ 商标权的主体</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-g8271"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>继受主体</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>商标权的主体</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
            </lrml:Statements><lrml:Statements key="priorities"><lrml:Comment>规则层的显式优先关系（Naf 例外由 lrml2ddl.py 自动转为优先关系）</lrml:Comment>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c21-2--c19"><lrml:Comment>不能辨认自己行为的未成年人（第21条第2款）优先于“八周岁以上为限制行为能力人”</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c21-2" under="#c19"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c18-emancipated--c19"><lrml:Comment>视为完全民事行为能力人优先</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c18-emancipated" under="#c19"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c145-refused--c145-consent"><lrml:Comment>确定不生效与有效互斥（同一事实不会同时满足；声明以防歧义）</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c145-refused" under="#c145-consent"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c-void-not-valid--c145-pure"><lrml:Comment>无效优先于有效（如同时违反强制性规定）</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c-void-not-valid" under="#c145-pure"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c-void-not-valid--c145-consent"><lrml:Comment>无效优先于有效</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c-void-not-valid" under="#c145-consent"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c-void-not-valid--c-revocable-valid"><lrml:Comment>无效优先于可撤销</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c-void-not-valid" under="#c-revocable-valid"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c152-1-1--c-revocation-right"><lrml:Comment>除斥期间经过，撤销权消灭</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c152-1-1" under="#c-revocation-right"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c152-1-1m--c-revocation-right"><lrml:Comment>重大误解九十日</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c152-1-1m" under="#c-revocation-right"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c152-1-2--c-revocation-right"><lrml:Comment>胁迫终止后一年</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c152-1-2" under="#c-revocation-right"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c152-1-3--c-revocation-right"><lrml:Comment>放弃撤销权</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c152-1-3" under="#c-revocation-right"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c152-2--c-revocation-right"><lrml:Comment>五年最长期间</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c152-2" under="#c-revocation-right"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c192-2a--c192-1"><lrml:Comment>届满后同意履行的，不得再抗辩</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c192-2a" under="#c192-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c399--c395"><lrml:Comment>禁止抵押财产</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c399" under="#c395"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c402-noreg--c403"><lrml:Comment>不动产须登记（防止把第403条误用于不动产）</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c402-noreg" under="#c403"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c403-oppose--c-oppose-default"><lrml:Comment>未登记动产抵押不得对抗善意第三人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c403-oppose" under="#c-oppose-default"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c404--c-oppose-default"><lrml:Comment>正常经营买受人规则</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c404" under="#c-oppose-default"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c423-after--c420-in"><lrml:Comment>确定后发生的债权不受担保</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c423-after" under="#c420-in"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c421--c407-follow"><lrml:Comment>最高额抵押：确定前部分债权转让，抵押权不随之转让</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c421" under="#c407-follow"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c449--c447"><lrml:Comment>法定或约定不得留置</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c449" under="#c447"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c374-oppose--c374-oppose-def"><lrml:Comment>未登记地役权不得对抗善意第三人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c374-oppose" under="#c374-oppose-def"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c528-resume--c527"><lrml:Comment>提供适当担保后应恢复履行</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c528-resume" under="#c527"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c551--c551-ok"><lrml:Comment>未经同意不生效</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c551" under="#c551-ok"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c551-2--c551-ok"><lrml:Comment>催告后沉默视为不同意</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c551-2" under="#c551-ok"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c546--c546-def"><lrml:Comment>未通知对债务人不生效</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c546" under="#c546-def"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c605--c604-before"><lrml:Comment>买受人原因迟延交付</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c605" under="#c604-before"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c607-1--c604-before"><lrml:Comment>交付承运人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c607-1" under="#c604-before"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c607-2--c604-before"><lrml:Comment>交付第一承运人</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c607-2" under="#c604-before"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c608--c604-before"><lrml:Comment>买受人违约未收取</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c608" under="#c604-before"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c610--c604-after"><lrml:Comment>质量不符致目的不能实现，买受人拒收/解除</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c610" under="#c604-after"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c610--c605"><lrml:Comment>质量不符优先</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c610" under="#c605"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c610--c607-1"><lrml:Comment>质量不符优先</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c610" under="#c607-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c610--c607-2"><lrml:Comment>质量不符优先</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c610" under="#c607-2"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c610--c608"><lrml:Comment>质量不符优先</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c610" under="#c608"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c604-agreed--c604-after"><lrml:Comment>另有约定</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c604-agreed" under="#c604-after"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c726-2--c726"><lrml:Comment>十五日内未表示购买视为放弃</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c726-2" under="#c726"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1063--c1062"><lrml:Comment>个人财产优先于共同财产的列举（含第1062条第4项但书）</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1063" under="#c1062"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1064-2-proof--c1064-2"><lrml:Comment>债权人举证共同用途</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1064-2-proof" under="#c1064-2"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1125-2--c1125"><lrml:Comment>宽恕</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1125-2" under="#c1125"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1201-supp--c1199"><lrml:Comment>第三人侵权时教育机构只承担补充责任</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1201-supp" under="#c1199"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1201-supp--c1200"><lrml:Comment>第三人侵权时教育机构只承担补充责任</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1201-supp" under="#c1200"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1191-1--c1165-1"><lrml:Comment>替代责任：工作人员不对受害人直接承担责任</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1191-1" under="#c1165-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1191-2--c1165-1"><lrml:Comment>劳务派遣：用工单位承担</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1191-2" under="#c1165-1"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1246--c1245-def"><lrml:Comment>违反管理规定的，重大过失不能减免</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1246" under="#c1245-def"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1246-reduce--c1245-def"><lrml:Comment>违反管理规定的，被侵权人故意只能减轻</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1246-reduce" under="#c1245-def"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1247--c1245-def"><lrml:Comment>烈性犬等无免责事由</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1247" under="#c1245-def"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1247--c1246-reduce"><lrml:Comment>烈性犬等无免责事由</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1247" under="#c1246-reduce"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
    <lrml:OverrideStatement key="ov-c1123-agreement--c1123-will"><lrml:Comment>遗赠扶养协议优先于遗嘱</lrml:Comment><lrml:Override over="#c1123-agreement" under="#c1123-will"/></lrml:OverrideStatement>
  </lrml:Statements>
</lrml:LegalRuleML>
